From f6a830aa5499d27cf77c28fed9a5b90d6d9e654e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Catherine Grabar <catherine.grabar@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:54:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] M1: Continue/New Farm title flow; M2: live-session
 replay harness

- Title screen: tap-anywhere continues the existing farm when an autosave
  exists (kid-friendly default), with an explicit New Farm button;
  GameState.pending_load carries the choice into main
- ReplayLog gains base_save: sessions continued from an autosave replay
  from that snapshot instead of regenerating from seed; serialized in JSON
- SaveGame.load_dict helper; main loads the autosave on continue
- Milestone checks moved into SimWorld.apply_action (capability proofs are
  sim truth, P-4) so replays earn them identically
- tools/verify_replay.gd: compares a live session's action log against its
  autosave, excluding presentation-only fields (selected tool/seed)

Suites: unit 156/156, integration 20/20.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
